@startuml
' Activity Diagram - Delivery Management (SHORT)
skinparam swimlaneOrientation vertical

title Activity - Delivery Management (SHORT) (UC-D5)

|Shipper|
start
:Open shipper app;

|System|
:Authenticate shipper account;
if (Approved shipper?) then (Yes)
else (No)
  |Shipper|
  :See account not approved;
  stop
endif

|Shipper|
:Set availability to online;

|System|
:Send delivery job offer;

|Shipper|
:Review job details;
:Accept or decline job;

|System|
if (Accepted?) then (Yes)
  :Assign job to shipper;
  |External Systems (Maps API)|
  :Show pickup route;
  |Shipper|
  :Confirm pickup done;
  |System|
  :Set order Picked Up [BR-7];
  |External Systems (Maps API)|
  :Show dropoff route;
  |Shipper|
  :Confirm delivery done;
  |System|
  :Set order Delivered [BR-7];
  stop
else (Declined)
  :Offer job to others;
  stop
endif
@enduml
